      "content": "it's just that there's no \"way through\" it. you can't fix a body that's failing or bring back the people who are gone. it feels less like a dark tunnel and more like just... being stuck in a room where the lights are slowly being turned off one by one. i'm just tired of sitting here in the dark, waiting. i wish i had some kind of say in how this all goes.",
